%% Source: docs-src/error-handling.md

flowchart TD
    A([catch error]) --> B{instanceof AniLinkGraphQLError?}
    B -->|yes| B1[graphqlErrors
    plus partial data on error.data]:::gql
    B -->|no| C{instanceof AniLinkApiError?}
    C -->|yes| C1{status}
    C1 -->|429| C2[rateLimit.reset
    gives the quota window]:::api
    C1 -->|other| C3[status and data]:::api
    C -->|no| D{instanceof AniLinkAuthError?}
    D -->|yes| D1[Token missing or rejected]:::auth
    D -->|no| E{instanceof AniLinkNetworkError?}
    E -->|yes| E1[code: NETWORK_ERROR,
    TIMEOUT_ERROR, ABORTED_ERROR,
    or CIRCUIT_OPEN_ERROR]:::net
    E -->|no| F([rethrow]):::unknown

    classDef gql fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf,color:#1c3a5e;
    classDef api fill:#ffe6cc,stroke:#d79b00,color:#5e4200;
    classDef auth fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450,color:#5c1a1a;
    classDef net fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,color:#5e4a00;
    classDef unknown fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666666,color:#333333;
